<ol><li>Query for Name as shown above</li>
<li>Go to the Invoicing tab, and enter a GL Account for <b>Sales Account</b></li></ol>',
      p_success_msg            => 'GL Account for Revenue exists for this Inventory Item, no action required.',
      p_print_condition        => nvl('FAILURE','ALWAYS'),
      p_fail_type              => nvl('E','W'),
      p_print_sql_output       => nvl('RS','RS'),
      p_limit_rows             => nvl('N','Y'),
