      p_problem_descr          => 'You are encountering this error for a Credit Memo you are trying to import. Typically this happens due to Transaction Type setup, of the invoice you are trying to credit.',
      p_solution               => 'These are the steps to identify the reason for the error:<br>
<ol>
  <li>Find out the invoice you are trying to credit, and note the open balance on the invoice. Also check if there are any activities (like receipt application, adjustment, another credit memo etc.) on the invoice.</li>
